  "hero_summary_zh": "一阵刀光剑影过后，主宰的敌人就已被他斩落。他以剑刃的旋转切入战斗，在战场上英勇无畏，迅疾非常，敌人基本没有招架的余地，抵挡住主宰就跟从他手中逃脱一样绝非易事。",
  "hero_summary_en": "In a flurry of slashes, Juggernaut cuts down his foes. Sprinting and spinning into battle with reckless abandon, and nearly invincible once he is able to begin his assault, stopping Juggernaut can often be just as difficult as surviving him.",
